        "text": "The Court held that New York\u2019s \u201cmay\u2011issue\u201d licensing regime, which requires applicants to demonstrate a special need for self\u2011defense, violates the Constitution\u2019s Second Amendment."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
